	"system": {
		"description": {
			"gm": "",
			"value": "<p><strong>Usage</strong> drawn on a willing creature</p><hr><p>This scratched rune reminds the bearer to stand strong against fear when near allies. As long as the rune-bearer is within 10 feet of one of its allies, whenever it would reduce its frightened condition by 1, it instead reduces it by 2.</p><p><strong>Invocation </strong>The essence of the rune is released outward, easing the minds of others. Each ally of the rune-bearer within a @Template[type:emanation|distance:10] reduces their frightened condition by 2.</p>"
		},
